  "apikey_info": {
    "domain": "site.info",
    "records": [
      {
        "type": "A",
        "value": "203.0.113.42",
        "ttl": 3600
      },
      {
        "type": "AAAA",
        "value": "2001:db8::1",
        "ttl": 3600
      },
      {
        "type": "MX",
        "value": "mail.site.info",
        "priority": 10,
        "ttl": 3600
      }
      // ... other record types
    ]
  }
}
```

Feel free to let me know if you’d like help interpreting the results or formatting them in a different way!
